{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First and foremost, this is an exceptionally content-rich game that seamlessly integrates three entirely distinct gameplay modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u200bSurvivor Mode, players can choose from nearly \u200b220 distinct skills to create exhilarating combat combinations, paired with approximately \u200b100,000 affixes that deliver a loot-driven experience rivaling Diablo's signature itemization depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the DEMO, only one character is currently available. Other characters can only be unlocked in the full version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc00-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc01-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc02-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u200bAuto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with \u200b70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling \u200bthousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety \u2013 our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the Demo, only 2 levels are currently available. The complete level experience will be unlocked in the full version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc03-C.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc04-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear \u2013 all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the Demo, only 1 story is available for players to experience. The full version will feature approximately 3\u20135 stories.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc05-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an indie game, it is of high quality and definitely worth owning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668610?t=1745322794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668610?t=1745322794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/01efa281cfd5402b5d1e50e9f9c833bc3e4946d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745322794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/01efa281cfd5402b5d1e50e9f9c833bc3e4946d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745322794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First and foremost, this is an exceptionally content-rich game that seamlessly integrates three entirely distinct gameplay modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In \u200bSurvivor Mode, players can choose from nearly \u200b220 distinct skills to create exhilarating combat combinations, paired with approximately \u200b100,000 affixes that deliver a loot-driven experience rivaling Diablo's signature itemization depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the DEMO, only one character is currently available. Other characters can only be unlocked in the full version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc00-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc01-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc02-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u200bAuto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with \u200b70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling \u200bthousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety \u2013 our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the Demo, only 2 levels are currently available. The complete level experience will be unlocked in the full version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc03-C.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc04-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear \u2013 all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(In the Demo, only 1 story is available for players to experience. The full version will feature approximately 3\u20135 stories.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/extras/Desc05-E.jpg?t=1745322794\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an indie game, it is of high quality and definitely worth owning.</p>","developers":["VoidStudio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2401740","name":"\u200bShattered Lands (\u7834\u788e\u4e4b\u5730)"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668610/564d8790e82bd0b4f383e98dd6f989a86ee6c16b/header.jpg?t=1745322794","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+(64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2Gb Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+(64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4Gb Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126570,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126570/movie480.mp4?t=1744852177","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126570/movie_max.mp4?t=1744852177"},"name":"Promotional Video - English01-Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com